# Actual SDK signature/snapshot and controller correlation functions only.
# Typed host status/projection/observation fixtures are NOT host/provider stubs,
# native proof or replacement for the core's actual host-validate call.
use test.fixtures.orchestrator_acceptance.controller_container_dispatch_v2.*
